Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever felt you were going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember how long ago\Nit was, but there was one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was during a fight with the last general\Nof the Dark Knights, or the one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't think I'd make it out of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually you brought\Nhis head back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You felt it then, never again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell someone like you worries\Nabout dying, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not true, my dear Bercouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel death hovering\Nover me every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is there in my dreams and\Nin the morning when I awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I still do not control everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I still have enemies who live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:01:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because the longer I live, it is\Npossible that at some point in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there will come a new enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point taken, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess being the Pontifex\Nisn't easy after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get what you\Nmeant then, but I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you more!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you more! I want you more!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want
