Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you're looking much\Nhealthier this morning, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your appetite's back with a vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps spending the night with\Nfour lovely ladies is the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Emperor Vecta's\Ngot some bold strategies in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking a risk, and\Nit's gonna cost him big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is war, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to remind you, this\Nain't the time for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's making their way\Nacross that canyon Asuna made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to stop them. Chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to cast some ropes over to the\Nother side, and send your people across.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they fall, they fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Execute anyone who doesn't comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The five tribes should be\Nconquering the human empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not chasing after some priestess of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.02,0:05:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out here dying for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on! Move it! Get across! All\Nof you! Hurry! Before the enemy notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Integrity Knights are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the ropes till\Nthe rest of us get across!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't no war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't even defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My people trained for this, to shimmy\Nacross a rope and die for no reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Human Empire's A.I.s are slightly\Nsuperior to the Dark Territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as adaptability goes,\Nthey're on a whole other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up, Critter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blow it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF4EFF0&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(964.847,869.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(12,132,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(25,145,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(38,158,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(51,171,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(64,184,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(77,197,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(90,210,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(103,223,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(116,236,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(129,249,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(142,262,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(155,275,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(168,288,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(181,301,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(194,314,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(207,327,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(220,340,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(233,353,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(246,366,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(259,379,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(272,392,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(285,405,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(298,418,\alpha&H00&)}5 {\alpha&HFF&\t(311,431,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(324,444,\alpha&H00&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(337,457,\alpha&H00&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(350,470,\alpha&H00&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(363,483,\alpha&H00&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(376,496,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(389,509,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(402,522,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(415,535,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(428,548,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(441,561,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(454,574,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(467,587,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(480,600,\alpha&H00&)}e
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for my next trick, sinking the\Nunderworld's time to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What no way is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pvp with lifelike human avatars?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And realistic violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean we can like cut\Noff arms and heads and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No restrictions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell to the yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This developer's adventurous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so signing up for this! Beta!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's enough Dark Knight\Naccounts for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go forth, my dudes, and the\Nchocolate human army to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something. But what?
