Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial-BoldMT-Str\blur0.9\fs80\c&HF1EBEE&\frz359.8\pos(971.2,782.4)}Kirigaya Kazuto
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, it's Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to call so late,\Nbut it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a taxi waiting out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent the address in the\Nfastest route to your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy and Mommy are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain on the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.52,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF3F0EE&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(742.4,190.4)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(20,140,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(41,161,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(62,182,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(83,203,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(104,224,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(125,245,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(146,266,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(167,287,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(188,308,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(209,329,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(230,350,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(251,371,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(272,392,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(293,413,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(314,434,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(335,455,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(356,476,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(377,497,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(398,518,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(419,539,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(440,560,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(460,580,\alpha&H00&)}2 {\alpha&HFF&\t(481,601,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(502,622,\alpha&H00&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(523,643,\alpha&H00&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(544,664,\alpha&H00&)}K{\alpha&HFF&\t(565,685,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(586,706,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(607,727,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(628,748,\alpha&H00&)}g{\alpha&HFF&\t(649,769,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(670,790,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(691,811,\alpha&H00&)}a {\alpha&HFF&\t(712,832,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(733,853,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(754,874,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(775,895,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(796,916,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(817,937,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(838,958,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(859,979,\alpha&H00&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(880,1000,\alpha&H00&)}e
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Driver, take me to Minato\NWard in Tokyo, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I left without telling you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kazuto's in trouble and he needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:09:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been ten hours since Asuna\Nlogged into the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in there, it's been a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking her so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's end Altar can't\Nbe that far away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Keeks! The phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuoka and Subcon,\Ntalk to me. Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not supposed to\Ncall HQ unless it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Hiroki at Wrath Roppongi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got an issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's some kind of prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple visitors just showed up at\Nour location without an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they? Clients?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they're definitely not clients,\Nbut they seem to know a lot about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two teenage girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teenagers, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, they knew your name and that\Nyou were at Wrath HQ, so I let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said I should call you and ask you\Nto check the FLA rate of the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said it was urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one-to-one? Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hiroki, did the girls\Ntell you their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, but the names they\Ngave are obviously fake.
