Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said not to worry,\Nyou'd know who they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I wrote them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, one called herself\NSinon, and the other Leafa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds crazy, but that's\Nwhat they told me to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.82,0:10:36.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1272,0)\fs62\c&HF3EDEF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(966.98,770.8)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2982,3102,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(20,140,\alpha&H00&)\t(2994,3114,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(41,161,\alpha&H00&)\t(3007,3127,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(62,182,\alpha&H00&)\t(3020,3140,\alpha&HFF&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(83,203,\alpha&H00&)\t(3033,3153,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(104,224,\alpha&H00&)\t(3046,3166,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(125,245,\alpha&H00&)\t(3059,3179,\alpha&HFF&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(145,265,\alpha&H00&)\t(3072,3192,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(166,286,\alpha&H00&)\t(3085,3205,\alpha&HFF&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(187,307,\alpha&H00&)\t(3098,3218,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(208,328,\alpha&H00&)\t(3111,3231,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(229,349,\alpha&H00&)\t(3124,3244,\alpha&HFF&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(250,370,\alpha&H00&)\t(3137,3257,\alpha&HFF&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(271,391,\alpha&H00&)\t(3150,3270,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)\t(3163,3283,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(312,432,\alpha&H00&)\t(3176,3296,\alpha&HFF&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(333,453,\alpha&H00&)\t(3188,3308,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(354,474,\alpha&H00&)\t(3201,3321,\alpha&HFF&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(375,495,\alpha&H00&)\t(3214,3334,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)\t(3227,3347,\alpha&HFF&)}4{\alpha&HFF&\t(417,537,\alpha&H00&)\t(3240,3360,\alpha&HFF&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(437,557,\alpha&H00&)\t(3253,3373,\alpha&HFF&)}4{\alpha&HFF&\t(458,578,\alpha&H00&)\t(3266,3386,\alpha&HFF&)}0 {\alpha&HFF&\t(479,599,\alpha&H00&)\t(3279,3399,\alpha&HFF&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(500,620,\alpha&H00&)\t(3292,3412,\alpha&HFF&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(521,641,\alpha&H00&)\t(3305,3425,\alpha&HFF&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(542,662,\alpha&H00&)\t(3318,3438,\alpha&HFF&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(562,682,\alpha&H00&)\t(3331,3451,\alpha&HFF&)}L{\alpha&HFF&\t(583,703,\alpha&H00&)\t(3344,3464,\alpha&HFF&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(604,724,\alpha&H00&)\t(3357,3477,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(625,745,\alpha&H00&)\t(3370,3490,\alpha&HFF&)}N{\alpha&HFF&\t(646,766,\alpha&H00&)\t(3383,3503,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(667,787,\alpha&H00&)\t(3395,3515,\alpha&HFF&)}w {\alpha&HFF&\t(688,808,\alpha&H00&)\t(3408,3528,\alpha&HFF&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(708,828,\alpha&H00&)\t(3421,3541,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(729,849,\alpha&H00&)\t(3434,3554,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,870,\alpha&H00&)\t(3447,3567,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(771,891,\alpha&H00&)\t(3460,3580,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(792,912,\alpha&H00&)\t(3473,3593,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(813,933,\alpha&H00&)\t(3486,3606,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(834,954,\alpha&H00&)\t(3499,3619,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(854,974,\alpha&H00&)\t(3512,3632,\alpha&HFF&)}F{\alpha&HFF&\t(875,995,\alpha&H00&)\t(3525,3645,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(896,1016,\alpha&H00&)\t(3538,3658,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(917,1037,\alpha&H00&)\t(3551,3671,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(938,1058,\alpha&H00&)\t(3564,3684,\alpha&HFF&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(959,1079,\alpha&H00&)\t(3577,3697,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(979,1099,\alpha&H00&)\t(3590,3710,\alpha&HFF&)}2
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, he's in a coma and he still\Nmanaged to get caught up in something crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, a full-on AI called Alice who was\Nborn in a virtual world made by the SDF?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is way beyond VR games\Nand there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so special and they just\Nwant her to fly fighter jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, yes, but\Nthey won't right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath will probably use her to demonstrate\Nthe technology to the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hijackers aboard the Ocean Turtle,\Nhowever, aren't interested in demonstrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think once they get her, they'll\Nuse her for what she was intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know anything else about those creeps?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like who they are or where they're from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think they're U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,military or intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, I can't confirm\Nthey're involved with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they are, and Alice\Ndoes fall into their hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll use her for drone warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Daddy and Mommy wouldn't\Nwant that to happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Alice…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice is proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her existence proves all VR\Nworlds starting with SAO are real,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that those who lived\Nin them had real lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the result of\Nmassive amounts of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy, and imagination\Nof thousands of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond a doubt, she's why\Nthe seed package was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its true purpose, to give\Nbirth to someone like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throughout all the connected worlds\Nthat sprang up from the seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so many people have laughed, cried,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suffered, and loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the radiance of all those\Nsouls shimmering with life that made
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it possible for a new form of\Nhumanity to be born in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy and Mommy, Leafa, Klein,\NLisbeth, Silica, Agil, and Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the combination of your\Nhearts and so many others,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all woven together in a big\Ntapestry that gave birth to Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And our hearts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowing like a big river.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:12:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:12:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue Kirito and Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever it takes\Nto get them out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have come to us sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a chance to get them\Nout, hell, we're taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe him as much as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About damn time I started paying him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's 30,000 American VR MMO players\Ndiving, and soon it could go up to 100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Human Army's just a\Nbunch of targets to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's stopping us from\Ndoing what the hijackers did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can post on the same\NUS VR MMO sites, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll tell the players about the\Nexperiment and the fake beta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure they'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the center of it\Nall is the struggle for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,military secrets between\NJapan and America.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we told anyone about that,\Nit would just make this worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we said they'd be killing real\Npeople, not avatars, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we tear a page out of their playbook
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll post a notice for\Nthe beta test ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we get the RAF guys\Nto hand out accounts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet we could get 30\Nor 40,000 logged on easy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea, man, but there's one\Nproblem. You gonna tell me what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in Japan, it's 4.30 in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides us, there's not a\Nwhole lot of folks online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in Los Angeles, it's\Nhalf past noon right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In New York, at 3:30 p.m., the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has way more active players online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aikil is correct about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't get the number\Nof players we need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be way less than 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our accounts would be the same level as\Nthe Americans, so we'd be evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting all of them\Noff would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like, maybe Wrath has more god\Naccounts like the one Asuna's using.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't start from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need as much time as\NKirito to level up enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, game over then. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are strong accounts, both in\Nterms of level and in equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Americans' default\Naccounts can't compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The accounts are already yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones you're\Nlogged in with now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must convert them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you and all the other\NVR MMO players you recruit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will start with stronger\Naccounts than the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all leveled up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just convert and log in. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't any of us think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I should mention,\Nthis plan involves some risk.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.76,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF0E9EB&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(968.58,862)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(24,144,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(49,169,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(73,193,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(98,218,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(122,242,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(147,267,\alpha&H00&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(171,291,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(196,316,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(220,340,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(245,365,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(270,390,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(294,414,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(319,439,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(343,463,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(368,488,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(392,512,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(417,537,\alpha&H00&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(441,561,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(466,586,\alpha&H00&)}5{\alpha&HFF&\t(490,610,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(515,635,\alpha&H00&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(540,660,\alpha&H00&)}2 {\alpha&HFF&\t(564,684,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(589,709,\alpha&H00&)}M {\alpha&HFF&\t(613,733,\alpha&H00&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(638,758,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(662,782,\alpha&H00&)}L{\alpha&HFF&\t(687,807,\alpha&H00&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(711,831,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(736,856,\alpha&H00&)}N{\alpha&HFF&\t(760,880,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(785,905,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(810,930,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(834,954,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(859,979,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(883,1003,\alpha&H00&)}l {\alpha&HFF&\t(908,1028,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(932,1052,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(957,1077,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(981,1101,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(1006,1126,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(1030,1150,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(1055,1175,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(1080,1200,\alpha&H00&)}n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to tell you\Nis not some kind of prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a place called the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a virtual world based on the\Nseed, made by Japanese researchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I stand here, tens of thousands of\NAmerican players are logging into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been told it's a beta\Nfor a hack and slash game,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they can kill anyone they come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the people of the Underworld are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not just NPCs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're true bottom-up AIs, with\Nfeelings and souls, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your help to protect them,\Nbut there's no time to level up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you convert your character\Naccounts to the Underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can save their people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you well, and I\Ntrust your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have called us so early\Njust so you could play a trick on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fact Kirito hasn't\Nlogged on for over ten
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,days suggests whatever is\Ngoing on is indeed serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But A .I.'s with human souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,military out to steal them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all seems so far-fetched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diving in would be the\Nonly way to confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In private,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you told me you had other concerns, that\Nconverting our accounts would have risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should explain what\Nthose are before we decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Underworld isn't a VR MMO game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simulated civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you'll be faced with a\Nfew issues once you dive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first one is, there's no user\Ninterface to call up and manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're logged in, you\Ncan't log yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way for you to log\Nout is by dying in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brings me to another issue\Nyou all need to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The underworld doesn't have a pain\Nabsorber function if you take enough
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damage to drop your HP to zero you'll\Nexperience loads of virtual pain and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, the Underworld is\Nin a chaotic state. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now and the devs can't\Nfully operate it so once you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,convert your character data\Nto the underworld there's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee you'll\Nbe able to convert it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And worse, if you die there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance you might\Nlose your character forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did she ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we help them lose our characters,\Nare you gonna reimburse us for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is this a trick to weaken the\Ntribe so you can take over? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not tricking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know how hard you work\Nto build your characters up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no amount of money\Ncan replace their loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not asking this lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're begging you to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our friends are fighting the American\Nplayers alongside the Underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're outnumbered and\Nthey need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all SAO survivors, so you\Nshould be tough enough to deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw your sob story!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're all that just\Nbecause you were in that game?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here's your chance to\Nprove how badass you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we care about\Nhijackers or AIs with souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bring this real-life crap\Ninto our game and expect us to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the rest of your\NSAO club can deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go save the day again, you stuck-up jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I say, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a real-life problem,\Nand as for us survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah some of us do blur the\Nline between the real world and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the virtual but we don't\Nthink we're tougher or better
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than anyone here none of us\Nthink we're heroes me and Silica
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she and I go to a special school for\Nsurvivors once a month the students
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to go to counseling because of the\Ntrauma we still deal with they ask us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,painful questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make some of the kids take\Nmedication, even though it makes them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're afraid of us, so they\Nmonitor us like we're a bunch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, it's not just us at the\Nreturnee school they're suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all VR MMO players.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think we're all a bunch of deadbeats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losers dragging society
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:21:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cowards who don't pay taxes\Nand can't face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are saying we need\Nthe draft back to force
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us to enlist because at\Nleast we can be useful there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though they think that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about us, you know what I believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That this here, this is reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world and all the other\NVirtual worlds connected
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to it they're real they're\Nnot just games we play here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in VR I have a real life and\NI have real friends I laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I cry and I feel real\Nfeelings the same as offline
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't it like that for you we\Npour our hearts and souls into
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this world because it's different\Nfrom what we got out there but
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's all just a stupid game\Neverything we've been through
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And felt here is fake. If so, then\Nin the end what is real for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the worlds we've grown fused together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:22:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're as thick and\Ntall as the world tree
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and from them from them the underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started to bloom I want\Nto protect it so please
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please, help us.
